From: XR1710G local integration
Subject: [PATCH] mt76: backport YYH NPU poll and TX completion fixes

Reference: https://github.com/YYH2913/openwrt
Branch: xr1710g-6.18-integration
Commit: 9e44788d769164dc9f691670add71dc466d99a4c
Adapted patches: 0199, 0201, 0206, 0208, 0209, 0159, 0216.
Original author: Yanghan Ye <yyh94306@gmail.com>

Adapt TXFREE v7 hunk around current MLD handling; omit the declaration
context for an RX teardown helper absent from this mt76 version.
Preserve existing B21 reset, ADC and translated-MSDU guards.
These changes are a candidate for the HE20 bidirectional imbalance,
not a confirmed throughput fix. Hardware validation remains required.

